  m_Name: Story_priya
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NpcStoryArc
  npcId: priya
  title: Shoes That Don't Hurt
  summary: 'Priya is an exhausted nurse and single mum. She sees more and more patients sick from the river, and a shiny Sterling clinic offers her double pay with a clause that forbids talking to the press. Fork: stay at the hospital and hand over her (anonymous) patient records, or take the clinic job.'
  pathAName: Stay at the hospital
  pathBName: Take the clinic job
  parts:
  - title: Before the duct tape
    number: 1
    heartsNeeded: 1
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - I meant it, you know. If you cut yourself on a scythe, you come to me. Not to Frank. Frank's answer to everything is duct tape.
    - Last month he taped up his own thumb and kept working. I had to take it off with olive oil and a lecture.
    happy: 0
