  - title: My grandmother's tea
    number: 2
    heartsNeeded: 2
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Can I ask a favour? My grandmother used to make a tea with apples and spice when anyone was run down. I'm run down.
    - The apples at the tower taste of nothing. Three from a real tree would be wonderful. Only if you have them spare.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ac67ad7bf2de88441b45e9cfe51c91bf, type: 2}
      amount: 3
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: Apples for Priya's tea
      questText: Priya wants three apples for her grandmother's tea. She says she's run down.
      reminder:
      - Apples, if you've got any spare? Three. No rush. Well. A little rush. I'm very tired.
      thanks:
      - Oh, they smell like her kitchen.
      - Thank you. Here, for your trouble. Don't argue, I'm a nurse, I win arguments professionally.
    choice:
      enabled: 0
      optionA: 
      replyA: []
      flagsA: []
      optionB: 
      replyB: []
      flagsB: []
    setFlags: []
    reward:
      gold: 120
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      friendship: 0
  - title: Asleep on the bench
    number: 3
    heartsNeeded: 3
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Did I fall asleep on the plaza bench yesterday? I did, didn't I. In the middle of the afternoon, with my shopping.
    - Dev says you made sure he got dinner. Pasta, he says. Again.
    - Thank you. I'm not used to people looking after us. I'm usually the one doing the looking.
