      friendship: 0
  - title: Which kind of tired?
    number: 8
    heartsNeeded: 8
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - I have to give the clinic an answer by Friday.
    - If I stay at the hospital, I'm tired and broke and I keep my notebook. Lucia says city hall needs exactly that kind of record for the river case. No names, just patterns.
    - If I take the clinic, I'm rested, and Dev gets new boots, and I never say a word about the river again.
    - I know what my grandmother would say. I want to hear what you say.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
      questText: 
      reminder: []
      thanks: []
    choice:
      enabled: 1
      optionA: Stay, and give city hall the records
      replyA:
      - Stay. Yes. I'll be tired, but I'll be able to look at myself in the mirror.
      - I'll copy the notebook tonight. Anonymous. Every street, every rash, every cough. Lucia can have it on Monday.
      flagsA:
      - priya_stayed
      - tower_file_patients
      optionB: Take the clinic job
      replyB:
      - The clinic. Sleep. Boots that fit. I'm allowed to want that, aren't I?
      - I'll keep the notebook in the drawer. With the birthday card.
      flagsB:
      - priya_clinic
    setFlags: []
    reward:
      gold: 0
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      friendship: 0
  - title: Tired and proud
    number: 9
    heartsNeeded: 9
    path: 1
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - City hall has my records. Lucia called them 'the clearest thing on my desk'. The hospital board heard about it and gave me a pay rise. A small one. Very small. Still.
    - I worked a double shift yesterday and came home to Dev asleep on the sofa with a pan of pasta for me on the stove.
    - I'm tired. I'm always going to be tired. But it's a good tired now.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
      questText: 
